            "notes": "## Items\n\nGet [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and stack green items.\n\nIf you have enough money, you can get [Bomb Diffusal Boots](item_c555901e-1b69-4040-8420-ee81cbaf6d90). It lets you reach highgrounds.\n\n[Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) is also very useful, especially if you are under a lot of pressure.\n\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) is the more offensive item.\n\n[Technoleech](item_cb7fd8bf-bdcc-439a-ad35-372f24a027a8) is also solid and similar to [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) but it has HP. \n\nLastly, [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) is great VS flying/airborne heroes like Freja, Pharah, Genji, Winston, DVA, Mercy, or Juno. Very underrated if you get jumped since you can slow them.",
