            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Frontliners](item_20863047-0978-4bcd-b75f-499fac432ff0) pairs well with [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7), since the field follows you around. It scales with HP, and you should use it mostly in duels. Don't use this just to heal unless you absolutely have to.\n\n## Items\n\nGet [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) and keep stacking green items.\n\nTake [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) or [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) if it's a poor round.\n\nIf you're rich, you can replace one of the green items with a rare one from the optional picks. Some of them are counterpick items:  \n- [Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) is good VS Soldier, Cass, and Zen.  \n- [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) is good VS Freja, Pharah, DVA, Winston, Mercy, Genji, or Juno.",
