            "notes": "## Items\n\nMore damage with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054).  \nYou can take either [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or another green HP item like [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da).\n\nIf you're poor, go for [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).  \nIt's more important to use up all your item slots when you're low on money.  \nFor example, two green HP items and [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) is better than just [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) alone.\n\nIf you are rich, grab one of the rare items from R3 to replace a green HP item.\n\nAt this point in the game, [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) is useful too if you feel like you're running out of ammo fast. You can replace [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) if you want, especially against shields.",
