            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Track and Field](item_b3750fe4-e416-42b6-ad9e-fe92c7dcffc5) in most games, since we put two powers into the field. This allows us to pick more offensive items. If you aren't under pressure, you can take [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) instead.\n\n## Items\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is the main damage item this round. Then we fill out the remaining slots with rare items. If you lack money, just use [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) instead of one of the rare items.\n\nIf you need a more tanky loadout, you can take [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) instead of [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b). [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is also good VS bursty heroes.\n\nIf you have a lot of money, you can upgrade [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) for [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), or try to fit in another epic item.",
