            "notes": "## Items\n\nThis round you will have to get a defensive item, if you dont have one already. I usually go with [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) because soldier ult is not the best and the stat increase basiccally beats out any other item when its active. 10% WP  and 10% AS is VERY noticeable.\n\nThe other options are [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8).  [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is good VS burst heroes like Freja or Pharah, anyone that deals more than 150 in one hit really.\n\nReplace the last green item with a rare item of your choice.",
