            "created_at": "2025-08-29T01:26:30.176333+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) is just more damage if you hold down the gun.\n\n## Items\n\nUsually, the main damage item is [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce). You can take [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) in poor rounds.\n\nSwap [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) in place of [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) if there's a lot of armor.\n\nVery similar logic applies with [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4): You can take either [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) or [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2),\nbut [Stockpile](item_a113eb56-9999-4f22-9bd7-18f4dbd00cc2) does about 80% of what [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) does \u2014 so it should NOT be the priority.\n\n[Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) is great VS shields. I've found this item to be very good against Winston especially, since his bubble breaks so fast that he often dies before being able to jump out.\n\nIn healing-heavy games, you can replace [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) with [El-sa'ka Suppressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) if you have the money for it.\n\nLastly, if you're still under a lot of pressure and mostly just need to survive to win,  \nthen you can pick [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c).",
